WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:29.260
[A young girl sitting at table handles a bracelet made of beads, putting it in her mouth, then back down on the table.

00:01:30.240 --> 00:01:36.000
[She moves her fingers about her mouth, picking up and dropping the bracelet.]

00:01:49.840 --> 00:01:56.700
[The beads are now placed in front of her, but covered with a white cloth. She loses interest and does not attempt to remove the cloth.]

00:02:03.880 --> 00:02:15.520
[A young boy handles the bracelet while looking into the camera; then it is taken away and returned hidden under a white cloth.]

00:02:16.360 --> 00:02:24.000
[He ignores the cloth, looking and gesturing to his right, and then appears uncertain.]

00:02:32.840 --> 00:02:38.660
[Another boy is given a bracelet of beads and handles it, occasionally smiling.]

00:02:55.460 --> 00:03:15.480
[Again the object is taken and returned to him under a cloth. He appears uncertain, then looks up and smiles.]

00:03:18.360 --> 00:03:26.000
[Another child is presented with the beaded bracelet. The child slaps first the palm and then the back of one hand with it.]

00:03:36.600 --> 00:03:45.000
[The bracelet is presented under a white cloth, and the child bends their head down, then looks around. The cloth is not touched.]

00:03:56.240 --> 00:04:10.380
[The next boy picks up the bracelet and hands it back to a person offscreen.]

00:04:10.380 --> 00:04:16.040
[After it's presented under the white cloth, he picks up the bracelet and cloth together and hands them to someone offscreen.]

00:04:21.600 --> 00:04:31.560
[Different objects are placed in front of the children, one child at a time. They handle them and sometimes appear to smell or taste them.]

00:04:37.940 --> 00:04:46.000
[The white cloth appears off and on. Some children play and show curiousity, others mostly ignore the objects and cloth.]

00:05:46.940 --> 00:05:56.760
[A small object is placed under a larger one, then removed. Childrens' reactions vary. Some look for the missing small object.]

00:07:01.760 --> 00:07:13.720
[The children continue to handle the objects, which come and go. There are multiple pieces which fit one into another.]

00:08:16.520 --> 00:08:26.020
[Now the object is placed in front of the children but behind a clear barrier. The children respond in different ways, some with frustration,

00:09:02.520 --> 00:09:10.940
some with an understanding that they must reach behind the barrier to retrieve the object.]

00:09:23.300 --> 00:09:31.080
[Objects with candies hidden beneath them are placed in front of the children. The children find and eat the candies.]

00:10:15.933 --> 00:10:25.733
[A mirror is placed in front of each child. Some seem to recognize themselves while others do not.]

00:10:29.860 --> 00:10:31.860
[One girl mouths the mirror, as she has earlier items.]

00:10:31.860 --> 00:10:38.920
[Others make faces at themselves or place their faces very close to the mirror. One boy points at his reflection.]

